                    <div class="laravel-knowledge-accordion__body">
                        <p>Takaful is a system based on the principles of brotherhood and mutual help, derived from the Arabic word &ldquo;Takaful,&rdquo; meaning &ldquo;joint or mutual guarantee.&rdquo; It operates as a community-pooling system, where participants contribute to a common fund to provide assistance to those in need. Takaful promotes solidarity, brotherhood, and the practice of mutual and cooperative concepts within the community.</p>
